Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:56:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 262/272] dt-bindings: usb: fcs,fsa4480: Add the Halo HL5280

The HL5280 is register compatible with the FSA4480: it reads device ID
0x49 and comes out of reset with the FSA4480's switch enable (0x98) and
select (0x18) values. Allow it with the FSA4480 as fallback.
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/fcs,fsa4480.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/fcs,fsa4480.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/fcs,fsa4480.yaml
index 89b1fb90a..f64acc1e9 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/fcs,fsa4480.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/fcs,fsa4480.yaml
@@ -15,6 +15,7 @@ properties:
       - const: fcs,fsa4480
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - halo,hl5280
               - ocs,ocp96011
           - const: fcs,fsa4480
 
